<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><div class="container-x grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><div class="lg:col-span-5" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><div class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="faq-title" class="h-section"><?php esc_html_e( 'Price, timing and', 'craftline' ); ?> <span class="hl"><?php esc_html_e( 'the guarantee', 'craftline' ); ?></span></h2><span class="rule mt-8" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="card-accent reveal mt-10 p-7 sm:p-8" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><p class="text-xl font-semibold" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Something not covered here?', 'craftline' ); ?></p><p class="mt-2 font-medium opacity-80" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Call the office. A plumber or our dispatcher picks up, 7 days a week.', 'craftline' ); ?></p><a href="tel:+15555550142" class="btn btn-dark mt-6" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 4h3.2l1.6 4.2-2.1 1.4a11.5 11.5 0 0 0 6.7 6.7l1.4-2.1 4.2 1.6V19a1.6 1.6 0 0 1-1.7 1.6A16 16 0 0 1 3.4 5.7 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 5 4z"/></svg>(555) 555-0142</a></div></div><div class="stagger lg:col-span-7" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><details class="faq-item" style="--i:0" name="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'What does the call-out fee cover?', 'craftline' ); ?></span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'The $129 call-out covers travel and up to 30 minutes of diagnosis. If you go ahead with the repair, we take it off the bill. If you don\'t, that\'s all you pay.', 'craftline' ); ?></p></details><details class="faq-item" style="--i:1" name="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'What\'s included in a fixed price?', 'craftline' ); ?></span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Labor, standard parts such as fittings, valves and pipe, and cleaning up afterwards. It doesn\'t cover damage we couldn\'t see before opening a wall or floor. If we find any, we stop, show you, and price it separately before carrying on.', 'craftline' ); ?></p></details><details class="faq-item" style="--i:2" name="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'How fast can you get here in an emergency?', 'craftline' ); ?></span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Usually within 60 minutes inside our service area, at any hour. Call the emergency line rather than using the form, so the dispatcher can talk you through shutting the water off while the van drives over.', 'craftline' ); ?></p></details><details class="faq-item" style="--i:3" name="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'What does the two-year guarantee cover?', 'craftline' ); ?></span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Our labor on the repair we did. If a joint we made leaks or a fixture we fitted comes loose within two years, we come back and fix it at no charge. Parts carry the manufacturer\'s warranty, usually one to ten years.', 'craftline' ); ?></p></details><details class="faq-item" style="--i:3" name="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Are your plumbers licensed and insured?', 'craftline' ); ?></span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'Every plumber holds a state license and we carry $2 million in liability insurance. We can email the certificate before the visit if your landlord or building manager needs it.', 'craftline' ); ?></p></details><details class="faq-item" style="--i:3" name="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'When and how do I pay?', 'craftline' ); ?></span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><?php esc_html_e( 'By card or bank transfer once the job is finished and tested. For bathroom refits over $1,500 we take a 30% deposit for materials, with the rest due on completion.', 'craftline' ); ?></p></details></div></div></section>
